{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哪能撑？你刚才还不敢说话，现在连呼吸都忘了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.476, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？我刚才还不敢说话，现在连呼吸都忘了。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.561, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 289, "total_tokens": 344, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哼，哪能比？那两音连得还像两堵墙。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.276, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 268, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "哼，那两音连得还像两堵墙。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.556, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 290, "total_tokens": 335, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "那还用说，你留的木勺比玻璃杯还亮，我猜它一定比你的杯子更耐看。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.448, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "我猜是木勺，不过你留的比它还稳，我猜它一定比你的杯子更耐看。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.865, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 301, "total_tokens": 358, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台那端，我这就去。云邮箱得先拿好，不然箱子会乱。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.308, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "云箱得先收好，箱底再放个暖瓶。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.473, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 298, "total_tokens": 344, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "那路可走，我这就把车开给你，你负责挡路。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.203, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就把车停在路口，你负责等红绿灯。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.623, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 290, "total_tokens": 336, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天还帮老板把鱼排得比他的办公桌还整齐。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.309, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 228, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天还帮老板把鱼排得比他的办公桌还整齐。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.625, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 59, "prompt_tokens": 292, "total_tokens": 351, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁没注意？这扣子比我的鱼鳍还小，连鱼都嫌不够。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.595, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "小名？那叫‘鱼鳍扣子’，谁敢提？连鱼都敢提。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.203, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 65, "prompt_tokens": 294, "total_tokens": 359, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁让你不下场了？我这就给你讲个笑话，你快坐好，别光站着。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.347, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 274, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "我坐着，你坐着，我们俩一起坐，谁也不得少说话。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.458, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 294, "total_tokens": 342, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
